      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to spend the night hanging out with Otoha in her room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Without much for the two of us to do around here, I manage to coerce her into playing a few songs for me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She's a bit bashful about it at first since it's apparently weird to just play and sing for one guy in her room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I get that. It definitely is weird.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But we manage to counteract the discomfort by eighty-sixing the vocals and just maintaining different sorts of conversations while she strums away.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We talk about all sorts of things, none of them being noteworthy, as the sun is slowly overtaken by the moon.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Before we know it, it's almost midnight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I try to get Otoha to play an encore for me, with vocals this time-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But she promptly kicks me out of the room and tells me I'll need to come see her perform elsewhere if I want a real show.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's fine, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm perfectly content for what I did get to see.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because I realize that no one else will ever see it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And exclusivity is one of my favorite things in the world when I am the one benefiting from it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ otoha_love += 1",
